{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1394098,\"title\":\"Sister\",\"tagline\":\"I've kidnapped my sister today.\",\"overview\":\"Desperate to raise money for her younger sister's surgery, Hae-ran teams up with Tae-soo to kidnap her half-sister So-jin. So-jin wakes up confined in an unfamiliar place. Hae-ran and Tae-soo demand a hefty ransom, expecting her wealthy father to cough up the money. Upon discovering that one of her captors is her half-sister, So-jin enters a precarious alliance that blurs the lines between victim and perpetrator as she plots a counterattack against the ruthless Tae-soo.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xkYVyFZWMlmD3ILiBLdwvWwyIXG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xyEW0UbHZJhndSqaCgaUoMVYTfW.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"voteCount\":9,\"year\":2026,\"runtime\":87,\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"KR\",\"name\":\"South Korea\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Jin Sung-moon\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2807694,\"name\":\"Jin Sung-moon\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1418762,\"name\":\"Jung Zi-so\",\"character\":\"Seong Hae-ran\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jsUPFmY1HlML92ubVtSE8L8ovz6.jpg\"},{\"id\":1257624,\"name\":\"Lee Soo-hyuk\",\"character\":\"Jung Tae-soo\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/drqY2KOm6kcESbVPSNnOj4oa27b.jpg\"},{\"id\":1929192,\"name\":\"Cha Joo-young\",\"character\":\"Park So-jin\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zd5FDsiQkfpjdH5ZH1f3bgcx2Cq.jpg\"},{\"id\":3582463,\"name\":\"Jung Ji-woo\",\"character\":\"Radio DJ\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ePY68lxmCxWWFHFf7b5rQUUCoVT.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":509467,\"title\":\"The Vanished\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lTo5AEHuZwTjrn9Sk5quioEP7FS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z3OgVzd06puEx9KD68T5zzFTrdt.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"