with ex-wife, Tess.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9833,\"title\":\"The Phantom of the Opera\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aTsp2VTaCBiGs8w05OTXfD97FRZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p3P0eTh8AnqauhRZg0wgoBFvcjF.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The deformed Phantom who haunts the Paris Opera House causes murder and mayhem in an attempt to make the woman he loves a star.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9654,\"title\":\"The Italian Job\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eSkjK4kctyrWpFhxl35GPvSs6tI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/scub2eRSY0c3feyVIZhjZFXvgeV.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Charlie Croker pulled off the crime of a lifetime. The one thing that he didn't plan on was being double-crossed. Along with a drop-dead gorgeous safecracker, Croker and his team take off to re-steal the loot and end up in a pulse-pounding, pedal-to-the-metal chase that careens up, down, above and below the streets of Los Angeles.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9792,\"title\":\"The Hills Have Eyes\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2eJL1Ccr1FN3dm9OSDwyd8uaX1b.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vrFI0I3M8ROZduj9XbFDoQKZyao.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Based on Wes Craven's 1977 suspenseful cult classic, The Hills Have Eyes is the story of a family road trip that goes terrifyingly awry when the travelers become stranded in a government atomic zone. Miles from nowhere, the Carter family soon realizes the seemingly uninhabited wasteland is actually the breeding ground of a blood-thirsty mutant family...and they are the prey.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9679,\"title\":\"Gone in Sixty Seconds\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fToQDmkBtiXYGh9xfgAh3gpo6GZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4GsvnaGqBGA78ccZusXvCH7zzun.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ex-car thief Randall Raines is forced out of retirement to save his brother Kip after a boost gone wrong. With the help of allies old and new, they race to meet the demands of notorious crime boss Raymond Calitri as the police are in hot pursuit.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9785,\"title\":\"The Invisible\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vSJloUNJSKWJzQ4RbxBFKOA2p2m.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6gmgk1rWMj5USt3Q9iy05MslNeM.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After an attack leaves him in limbo -- invisible to the living and also near death -- a teenager discovers the only person who might be able help him is his attacker.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":82,\"title\":\"Miami Vice\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1KGD2g0wOc7WBfHc5G19reLHQxk.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jYhMlpOJMIiDTGcwZsKikZ7FShq.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A case involving drug lords and murder in South Florida takes a personal turn for undercover detectives Sonny Crockett and Ricardo Tubbs. Unorthodox Crockett gets involved romantically with the Chinese-Cuban wife of a trafficker of arms and drugs, while Tubbs deals with an assault on those he loves.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5516,\"title\":\"The Ladykillers\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l4g9R39NCp6VaYFrw6q8JwKNW9x.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mdaBC7yEcorGC4uI9U5CEyfWsvK.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An eccentric, if not charming Southern professor and his crew pose as a band in order to rob a casino, all under the nose of his unsuspecting landlord – a sharp old woman.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":806,\"title\":\"The Omen\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kf1Qq9b32jn4umll9qD2ue5ftnh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cIdt86pqHfSZQRduKh0xFvnqtwE.jpg\",\"rating\":5.6,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A diplomatic couple adopts the son of the devil without knowing it. A remake of the classic horror film of the same name from 1976.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"Bnxdub0SPgQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"8mOveiRgOX4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"mQTh99B0ql8\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}